GOSSIP PROTOCOL Tiers:
  Tier 1: Peer Discovery (SWIM) + AES-256 Encryption + mTLS
  Tier 2: Capability & Subscription Sharing
  Tier 3: Federated Search (cross-node fan-out)
  Tier 4: Catalog-Guided Search + Manifest Gossip
  Tier 5: Semantic Subscription Routing (cosine similarity)

Auto-Discovery Sequence:
  1. Edge nodes start with seeds=[hub:7946]
  2. Connect to seed, exchange member list
  3. Begin SWIM gossip: probe_interval, gossip_interval
  4. Maintain peer table (alive/suspect/dead)
  5. Broadcast PeerInfo with capabilities and subscriptions


