DIAGRAM 2: SECURITY & mTLS AUTO-CONNECTION FLOW
================================================================================

                    +------------------------+
                    |       NODE A           |
                    |  Clearance: SECRET     |
                    |  Role: hub             |
                    |  client_auth: strict   |
                    +-----------+------------+
                                |
                                |  1. mTLS Handshake
                                |     (TLS 1.3 + client cert)
                                v
                    +------------------------+
                    |       NODE B           |
                    |  Clearance: CUI        |
                    |  Role: edge            |
                    +-----------+------------+
                                |
                                |  2. Certificate Exchange
                                |     CN=edge-02
                                |     OU=MDG-CLEARANCE:CUI
                                |     OU=MDG-ROLE:edge
                                |     OU=MDG-SITE:fd-2
                                v
                    +------------------------+
                    |   Guard Point 5        |
                    |   (Manifest Filtering) |
                    |                        |
                    |   Check: Can B see     |
                    |   manifest X?          |
                    |   B's clearance: CUI   |
                    |   Manifest level: TOP  |
                    |                        |
                    |   Result: BLOCKED      |
                    +-----------+------------+
                                |
                                |  3. Gossip Message (AES-256)
                                |     [BLOCKED - insufficient clearance]
                                v


                    +------------------------+
                    |       NODE A           |
                    |  Clearance: SECRET     |
                    +-----------+------------+
                                |
                                |  4. HTTP Request
                                |     GET /api/knowledge/search
                                |     Content-Type: application/json
                                v
                    +------------------------+
                    |       NODE B           |
                    |  Clearance: CUI        |
                    +-----------+------------+
                                |
                                |  5. Guard Point 4
                                |   (Search Result Filtering)
                                |                        |
                                |   For each result:     |
                                |   - Extract event      |
                                |     clearance          |
                                |   - Compare to caller  |
                                |     clearance          |
                                |   - Filter if event >  |
                                |     caller clearance   |
                                |                        |
                                |   Result: FILTERED     |
                                +-----------+------------+
                                |
                                |  6. Return filtered results
                                v
                    +------------------------+
                    |       NODE A           |
                    |  Receives results      |
                    |  at SECRET level       |
                    +------------------------+

