KEY PROPERTIES:
  - Lightweight: 6MB (HashVectorizer) to 40MB (StaticVectorizer + SQLite)
  - Modular: Store and Vectorizer are independent build axes
  - Edge-ready: Runs on Raspberry Pi Zero to full servers
  - Secure: mTLS, AES-256 gossip encryption, ABAC policy enforcement
  - Scalable: SWIM protocol scales to thousands of nodes (O(1) per node)
  - Federated: Cross-node search with clearance-based filtering

